WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.705
Roles and permissions decide who sees which screen in the Contact Center.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:10.172
This video shows the Agent and Supervisor roles and what each gets by

00:00:10.172 --> 00:00:14.758
default, how to give agents the soft phone, why a supervisor also needs

00:00:14.758 --> 00:00:19.940
an entitlement record, and the permissions for recordings, voicemail and reports.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.214
An agent takes calls.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:29.624
A supervisor watches the floor and reads reports.

00:00:29.624 --> 00:00:31.918
An administrator runs the site.

00:00:31.918 --> 00:00:35.390
Each should see only the screens that fit the job.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.396
A permission allows one thing.

00:00:38.396 --> 00:00:41.090
A role is a named set of permissions.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:45.790
A user can have several roles, and gets every permission of each one.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:51.913
The Contact Center comes with ready-made permission sets for three role names:

00:00:51.913 --> 00:00:54.600
Administrator, Agent and Supervisor.

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:00.960
Open Access Control, Roles.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.276
The Administrator role has every permission.

00:01:04.276 --> 00:01:07.392
There is no Agent or Supervisor role yet.

00:01:07.851 --> 00:01:10.930
Click Add Role, type Agent, and click Create.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:16.242
A role named exactly Agent receives the default Agent permissions of every feature

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.691
that is turned on.

00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:21.739
Add a second role named Supervisor the same way.

00:01:21.739 --> 00:01:23.205
Spelling counts:

00:01:23.205 --> 00:01:27.002
a role named Call Agent gets nothing automatically.

00:01:31.206 --> 00:01:32.854
Open the Agent role.

00:01:32.854 --> 00:01:35.833
Search permissions narrows the long list.

00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:36.974
Type queues:

00:01:36.974 --> 00:01:41.030
Sign in to Contact Center queues and campaigns is allowed.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.376
The Manage permissions are not.

00:01:43.832 --> 00:01:45.725
Type live interactions.

00:01:45.725 --> 00:01:51.728
An agent may pause recording and start a secure capture, on their own live calls only.

00:01:51.728 --> 00:01:53.750
Type own call recordings:

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:58.252
an agent can listen to their own calls, never to anyone else's.

00:01:58.703 --> 00:02:00.031
Type soft phone.

00:02:00.031 --> 00:02:03.050
Use the telephony soft phone is not allowed:

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.526
the Agent role does not include it.

00:02:05.526 --> 00:02:09.813
Tick it, and click Save, so agents can take calls in the browser.

00:02:14.045 --> 00:02:15.958
Open the Supervisor role.

00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:17.131
Type monitor:

00:02:17.131 --> 00:02:22.625
Monitor the Contact Center in real time is allowed, which opens the live dashboard.

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:23.797
Type reports:

00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:26.575
View Contact Center reports is allowed.

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:28.954
Type take over:

00:02:28.954 --> 00:02:35.299
a supervisor can take over, end, transfer and record live calls, and set agents' state.

00:02:35.299 --> 00:02:36.799
Type recordings:

00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:40.552
a supervisor listens to anyone's call recordings.

00:02:41.002 --> 00:02:42.139
Type queues:

00:02:42.139 --> 00:02:44.603
Sign in to queues is not allowed.

00:02:44.603 --> 00:02:49.469
A supervisor who also takes calls needs the Agent role as well, because

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:52.502
a user gets the permissions of every role.

00:02:56.689 --> 00:03:00.062
Open Access Control, Users, and edit a user.

00:03:00.062 --> 00:03:02.827
The Roles section lists every role.

00:03:02.827 --> 00:03:07.009
Tick Agent for an agent and Supervisor for a supervisor.

00:03:07.459 --> 00:03:10.771
A team lead who also takes calls gets both.

00:03:10.771 --> 00:03:11.919
Click Save.

00:03:16.113 --> 00:03:21.895
A role opens the screens, but a supervisor also needs an agent entitlement record.

00:03:21.895 --> 00:03:26.231
The live dashboard shows only the queues on your own record.

00:03:26.231 --> 00:03:31.093
Without one, the page opens but is empty, even for an administrator.

00:03:31.562 --> 00:03:35.774
Open Interaction Center, Management, Agent entitlements.

00:03:35.774 --> 00:03:40.259
Each agent has a record with the queues they may sign in to.

00:03:40.259 --> 00:03:44.472
Click Add agent entitlements to give the supervisor one.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:50.541
Pick the person under User, and under Allowed queues pick the queues they supervise.

00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:51.227
Save.

00:03:51.227 --> 00:03:55.713
The live dashboard and the shared voicemail now show those queues.

00:03:59.894 --> 00:04:02.899
Call recordings have three permissions.

00:04:02.899 --> 00:04:06.238
Listen to own call recordings is for agents.

00:04:06.238 --> 00:04:10.244
Listen to anyone's call recordings is for supervisors.

00:04:10.244 --> 00:04:13.984
Delete call recordings is for administrators only.

00:04:14.435 --> 00:04:16.470
Shared voicemail has two.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:21.919
Access shared queue voicemail for entitled queues lets a person work the box.

00:04:21.919 --> 00:04:27.828
Manage shared queue voicemail deletes messages and takes over other people's claims.

00:04:27.828 --> 00:04:31.045
Supervisors have both; agents have neither.

00:04:31.495 --> 00:04:34.752
Reports need View Contact Center reports.

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:39.395
Without it, the Reports menu shows no Contact Center reports.

00:04:43.595 --> 00:04:47.191
A team lead who also takes calls has both the Agent and the

00:04:47.191 --> 00:04:51.175
Supervisor role, and an entitlement record with the team's queues.

00:04:51.925 --> 00:04:55.966
A quality reviewer gets a role made by hand with only Listen to

00:04:55.966 --> 00:04:59.655
anyone's call recordings and View Contact Center reports.

00:05:00.405 --> 00:05:04.789
A company that gives agents the soft phone ticks Use the telephony soft

00:05:04.789 --> 00:05:08.205
phone once on the Agent role, instead of on each user.

00:05:08.955 --> 00:05:14.371
Only administrators can delete recordings, so a reviewer who can listen to everything

00:05:14.371 --> 00:05:16.395
still cannot erase anything.

00:05:18.395 --> 00:05:23.323
Name the roles Agent and Supervisor, tick the soft phone, give each supervisor

00:05:23.323 --> 00:05:27.020
an entitlement record, and the screens follow the people.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:28.545
Thanks for watching.

